🎲🎲🎲 EXIT CODE: 0 🎲🎲🎲
🟩🟩🟩 STDOUT️ 🟩🟩🟩️
Check whether contacts are compatible with a domain or a TLD.
If contacts are not compatible with either the domain or the TLD, the information that needs to be corrected is returned.

USAGE:
  scw domain contact check-compatibility [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  [domains.{index}]                                                            List of domains to check contacts compatibility against.
  [tlds.{index}]                                                               List of TLDs to check contacts compatibility against.
  [owner-contact-id]                                                           ID of the existing contact to check as the domain's owner.
  [owner-contact.legal-form]                                                   Legal form of the contact (individual, corporate, association, other). (legal_form_unknown | individual | corporate | association | other)
  [owner-contact.firstname]                                                    First name of the contact.
  [owner-contact.lastname]                                                     Last name of the contact.
  [owner-contact.company-name]                                                 Company name of the contact (required for corporate legal forms).
  [owner-contact.email]                                                        Email address of the contact.
  [owner-contact.email-alt]                                                    Alternative email address of the contact.
  [owner-contact.phone-number]                                                 Phone number of the contact, normalized to +CC.NationalNumber format.
  [owner-contact.fax-number]                                                   Fax number of the contact, normalized to +CC.NationalNumber format.
  [owner-contact.address-line-1]                                               First line of the contact's address.
  [owner-contact.address-line-2]                                               Second line of the contact's address.
  [owner-contact.zip]                                                          Postal code of the contact.
  [owner-contact.city]                                                         City of the contact.
  [owner-contact.country]                                                      Country code of the contact (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 format).
  [owner-contact.vat-identification-code]                                      VAT identification code of the contact.
  [owner-contact.company-identification-code]                                  Company identification code of the contact (SIRET/SIREN for French contacts, any format for others).
  [owner-contact.lang]                                                         Preferred language of the contact. (unknown_language_code | en_US | fr_FR | de_DE)
  [owner-contact.resale]                                                       Indicates whether the contact's information can be resold.
  [owner-contact.extension-fr.mode]                                             (mode_unknown | individual | company_identification_code | duns | local | association | trademark | code_auth_afnic)
  [owner-contact.extension-fr.individual-info.whois-opt-in]                    
  [owner-contact.extension-fr.duns-info.duns-id]                               
  [owner-contact.extension-fr.duns-info.local-id]                              
  [owner-contact.extension-fr.association-info.publication-jo]                 
  [owner-contact.extension-fr.association-info.publication-jo-page]            
  [owner-contact.extension-fr.trademark-info.trademark-inpi]                   
  [owner-contact.extension-fr.code-auth-afnic-info.code-auth-afnic]            
  [owner-contact.extension-eu.european-citizenship]                            
  [owner-contact.whois-opt-in]                                                 Indicates whether the contact's information is published in the WHOIS database.
  [owner-contact.state]                                                        State or region of the contact.
  [owner-contact.extension-nl.legal-form]                                       (legal_form_unknown | other | non_dutch_eu_company | non_dutch_legal_form_enterprise_subsidiary | limited_company | limited_company_in_formation | cooperative | limited_partnership | sole_company | european_economic_interest_group | religious_entity | partnership | public_company | mutual_benefit_company | residential | shipping_company | foundation | association | trading_partnership | natural_person)
  [owner-contact.extension-nl.legal-form-registration-number]                  
  [owner-contact.extension-it.pin]                                             Domain name registrant's Taxcode (mandatory / only optional when the trustee is used)
  [owner-contact.questions.{index}.question]                                   
  [owner-contact.questions.{index}.answer]                                     
  [administrative-contact-id]                                                  ID of the existing contact to check as the domain's administrative contact.
  [administrative-contact.legal-form]                                          Legal form of the contact (individual, corporate, association, other). (legal_form_unknown | individual | corporate | association | other)
  [administrative-contact.firstname]                                           First name of the contact.
  [administrative-contact.lastname]                                            Last name of the contact.
  [administrative-contact.company-name]                                        Company name of the contact (required for corporate legal forms).
  [administrative-contact.email]                                               Email address of the contact.
  [administrative-contact.email-alt]                                           Alternative email address of the contact.
  [administrative-contact.phone-number]                                        Phone number of the contact, normalized to +CC.NationalNumber format.
  [administrative-contact.fax-number]                                          Fax number of the contact, normalized to +CC.NationalNumber format.
  [administrative-contact.address-line-1]                                      First line of the contact's address.
  [administrative-contact.address-line-2]                                      Second line of the contact's address.
  [administrative-contact.zip]                                                 Postal code of the contact.
  [administrative-contact.city]                                                City of the contact.
  [administrative-contact.country]                                             Country code of the contact (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 format).
  [administrative-contact.vat-identification-code]                             VAT identification code of the contact.
  [administrative-contact.company-identification-code]                         Company identification code of the contact (SIRET/SIREN for French contacts, any format for others).
  [administrative-contact.lang]                                                Preferred language of the contact. (unknown_language_code | en_US | fr_FR | de_DE)
  [administrative-contact.resale]                                              Indicates whether the contact's information can be resold.
  [administrative-contact.extension-fr.mode]                                    (mode_unknown | individual | company_identification_code | duns | local | association | trademark | code_auth_afnic)
  [administrative-contact.extension-fr.individual-info.whois-opt-in]           
  [administrative-contact.extension-fr.duns-info.duns-id]                      
  [administrative-contact.extension-fr.duns-info.local-id]                     
  [administrative-contact.extension-fr.association-info.publication-jo]        
  [administrative-contact.extension-fr.association-info.publication-jo-page]   
  [administrative-contact.extension-fr.trademark-info.trademark-inpi]          
  [administrative-contact.extension-fr.code-auth-afnic-info.code-auth-afnic]   
  [administrative-contact.extension-eu.european-citizenship]                   
  [administrative-contact.whois-opt-in]                                        Indicates whether the contact's information is published in the WHOIS database.
  [administrative-contact.state]                                               State or region of the contact.
  [administrative-contact.extension-nl.legal-form]                              (legal_form_unknown | other | non_dutch_eu_company | non_dutch_legal_form_enterprise_subsidiary | limited_company | limited_company_in_formation | cooperative | limited_partnership | sole_company | european_economic_interest_group | religious_entity | partnership | public_company | mutual_benefit_company | residential | shipping_company | foundation | association | trading_partnership | natural_person)
  [administrative-contact.extension-nl.legal-form-registration-number]         
  [administrative-contact.extension-it.pin]                                    Domain name registrant's Taxcode (mandatory / only optional when the trustee is used)
  [administrative-contact.questions.{index}.question]                          
  [administrative-contact.questions.{index}.answer]                            
  [technical-contact-id]                                                       ID of the existing contact to check as the domain's technical contact.
  [technical-contact.legal-form]                                               Legal form of the contact (individual, corporate, association, other). (legal_form_unknown | individual | corporate | association | other)
  [technical-contact.firstname]                                                First name of the contact.
  [technical-contact.lastname]                                                 Last name of the contact.
  [technical-contact.company-name]                                             Company name of the contact (required for corporate legal forms).
  [technical-contact.email]                                                    Email address of the contact.
  [technical-contact.email-alt]                                                Alternative email address of the contact.
  [technical-contact.phone-number]                                             Phone number of the contact, normalized to +CC.NationalNumber format.
  [technical-contact.fax-number]                                               Fax number of the contact, normalized to +CC.NationalNumber format.
  [technical-contact.address-line-1]                                           First line of the contact's address.
  [technical-contact.address-line-2]                                           Second line of the contact's address.
  [technical-contact.zip]                                                      Postal code of the contact.
  [technical-contact.city]                                                     City of the contact.
  [technical-contact.country]                                                  Country code of the contact (ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 format).
  [technical-contact.vat-identification-code]                                  VAT identification code of the contact.
  [technical-contact.company-identification-code]                              Company identification code of the contact (SIRET/SIREN for French contacts, any format for others).
  [technical-contact.lang]                                                     Preferred language of the contact. (unknown_language_code | en_US | fr_FR | de_DE)
  [technical-contact.resale]                                                   Indicates whether the contact's information can be resold.
  [technical-contact.extension-fr.mode]                                         (mode_unknown | individual | company_identification_code | duns | local | association | trademark | code_auth_afnic)
  [technical-contact.extension-fr.individual-info.whois-opt-in]                
  [technical-contact.extension-fr.duns-info.duns-id]                           
  [technical-contact.extension-fr.duns-info.local-id]                          
  [technical-contact.extension-fr.association-info.publication-jo]             
  [technical-contact.extension-fr.association-info.publication-jo-page]        
  [technical-contact.extension-fr.trademark-info.trademark-inpi]               
  [technical-contact.extension-fr.code-auth-afnic-info.code-auth-afnic]        
  [technical-contact.extension-eu.european-citizenship]                        
  [technical-contact.whois-opt-in]                                             Indicates whether the contact's information is published in the WHOIS database.
  [technical-contact.state]                                                    State or region of the contact.
  [technical-contact.extension-nl.legal-form]                                   (legal_form_unknown | other | non_dutch_eu_company | non_dutch_legal_form_enterprise_subsidiary | limited_company | limited_company_in_formation | cooperative | limited_partnership | sole_company | european_economic_interest_group | religious_entity | partnership | public_company | mutual_benefit_company | residential | shipping_company | foundation | association | trading_partnership | natural_person)
  [technical-contact.extension-nl.legal-form-registration-number]              
  [technical-contact.extension-it.pin]                                         Domain name registrant's Taxcode (mandatory / only optional when the trustee is used)
  [technical-contact.questions.{index}.question]                               
  [technical-contact.questions.{index}.answer]                                 

DEPRECATED ARGS:
  [owner-contact.extension-it.european-citizenship]            This option is useless anymore
  [owner-contact.extension-it.tax-code]                        Tax_code is renamed to pin
  [administrative-contact.extension-it.european-citizenship]   This option is useless anymore
  [administrative-contact.extension-it.tax-code]               Tax_code is renamed to pin
  [technical-contact.extension-it.european-citizenship]        This option is useless anymore
  [technical-contact.extension-it.tax-code]                    Tax_code is renamed to pin

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for check-compatibility
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers       Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use
